;"><span style="flex:1;height:1px;background:#BFD4E4;"></span></div><h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:23px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.22;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 12px;text-wrap:balance;">Process recipes developed around the device</h3><p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;">Thinning and singulation conditions are qualified on first articles, allowing the process window to be matched to thin, brittle or otherwise sensitive die before volume production.</p><ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;"><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #CBDCEA;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;">Process recipe qualified on first articles</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #CBDCEA;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;">Chipping and crack data returned in writing</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #CBDCEA;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;">Cleanroom, ESD-controlled handling</span></li></ul></div></div><div class="why-cell why-photo-cell why-order-2"><div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--radius-panel);border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);width:100%;height:100%;min-height:320px;"><im